meta {
  name: Get Subscription Plans
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/master/subscription-plans
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Get Subscription Plans

  Public endpoint — no token required, on purpose. A master whose subscription
  has lapsed cannot log in at all, so the price list must stay reachable to show
  them what to renew.

  Only plans with `is_active = true` are returned, ordered by `sort_order`.
  `name` and `description` are already localized for the `X-Locale` header.

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "1 aý",
        "description": null,
        "duration_days": 30,
        "price": 150.00
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "name": "3 aý",
        "description": null,
        "duration_days": 90,
        "price": 400.00
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  **Note:** masters cannot buy from the app — there is no payment gateway.
  The administrator issues the subscription after taking payment.
}
